ts (-1) Moving Out of Franklin Township? Moving Out of Franklin Township? Please complete a transfer out form. Comments (-1) Parent Notification of Standardized Assessments Comments (-1) Franklin Township Public Schools Named a “High Performing District” on the NJ DOE - NJQSAC Continuum Comments (-1) Reminder to Please Check the Website for Approved District Flyers Flyers contain information and various events happening within our community. Comments (-1) More Headlines Updated:","ok":true,"op":"document"},"time":31},"model_calls":31,"document_judgments":19,"relevance_3":3,"max_document_judgments":50,"max_model_calls":100}
